      "description": "Ordinary landing action, as used in the closing band.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-primary\" href=\"#quickstart\">Create your first database <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>",
